# Build context for deploy/docker/Dockerfile (server + admin),
# deploy/docker/Dockerfile.cli (wt + worktree-bg), Dockerfile.server and
# apps/web/Dockerfile. All use the repository root as context. Patterns are
# anchored at the context root, so nested artifacts need a **/ prefix.

# VCS / CI / tooling
.git
.github/
.claude/
.turbo/
**/.turbo
.vscode/
.idea/

# Rust build output (sources and Cargo.lock ARE needed by Dockerfile.cli)
target/
**/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Dependencies (installed fresh in the image)
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store/

# Build outputs (rebuilt in the image)
**/.next
**/.source
**/dist
**/out
**/build
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
services/server-go/worktree-server
services/server-go/worktree-server.exe
release/

# Runtime data
**/wt-data
**/*.db

# Testing & coverage
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
tests/

# Logs
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/*.log

# Environment / secrets
**/.env
**/.env*.local
**/*.pem

# Editors & OS files
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Docs, deployment manifests & misc not needed by images
docs/
video/
scripts/
deploy/helm/
deploy/systemd/
deploy/launchd/
**/*.md
!apps/web/content/**/*.md
!apps/web/content/**/*.mdx
.vercel/
